{
  "work_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople",
  "source_path": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0009",
      "source_sha256": "082259436d30096b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The one who was caught up to the third heaven and heard mysterious words."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0043",
      "source_sha256": "8e6659c0949ca1b4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Having become obedient even to the point of death."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0052",
      "source_sha256": "28d3ebc3c43d547e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Those who do not weep over an injury or the loss of money."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0090",
      "source_sha256": "64ee668e6732fbe9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If this is difficult for you, at least give thirty, which is one third."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0095",
      "source_sha256": "54eac80e4f324067",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Then you will begin to confess them in that place, without a witness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0100",
      "source_sha256": "470c713c5c622a3f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For there is no repentance in this place."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0122",
      "source_sha256": "717f32bbe3ea3b9c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "As we always carry the death of our Lord Jesus Christ in our body."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0146",
      "source_sha256": "1c411b061bd3ac68",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "So that when we hear his voice, we will rise and meet him, ready."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0186",
      "source_sha256": "b9a5b2ba9e242504",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let us therefore always remember the one who endured all these things for our sins."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0196",
      "source_sha256": "53364d38b09daade",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Pleasure is like a dog."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0197",
      "source_sha256": "2657fca4d9834d2a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If you chase it away, it runs off; but if you feed it, it stays with you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0198",
      "source_sha256": "2b6b0b522f056d33",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For this reason James said, “Stand against the devil, and he will flee from you.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0199",
      "source_sha256": "5dfbc503bf299c7f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let us not think that it is possible for us to repent in Hades."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0200",
      "source_sha256": "f89fddb837bc59f0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For the medicine of repentance has no power in that place."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0210",
      "source_sha256": "820df7d4f2c49b1a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Even if someone spends his entire life eating and drinking, it is nothing compared with the endless ages."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0246",
      "source_sha256": "40b87fda8eb57ec3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And, “Return to me, children who have strayed, and I will heal your failings.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0256",
      "source_sha256": "9aa924ec52484cdd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And again, “Today, if you hear his voice, do not harden your hearts.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0257",
      "source_sha256": "a9bdadace1e111b0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For if a physician—even if the sick person becomes discouraged and insults him—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0258",
      "source_sha256": "db4cb74740b48e4d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] the physician despises him. Nor does he retaliate against him for the insults; instead, he gives him medicine with kindness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0259",
      "source_sha256": "c5aa788ecc62ce47",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "How much more will the good God, the true physician of our souls!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0260",
      "source_sha256": "304afc6cb27d19ad",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Only let us not neglect our own salvation."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0277",
      "source_sha256": "4c060f7a7b1435cc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "We will not see him through a riddle, but will behold him as he is, with our own eyes, according to the testimony of the apostle John, who speaks about God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0292",
      "source_sha256": "25ae85ce2b1254f0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If rulers make every effort to be honored by those sitting in the theaters, even though most of those there are poor, despised people, slaves, and foreigners, then how much more should we strive to be acclaimed in that theater, the place where the angels, the archangels, and all the saints gather!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0328",
      "source_sha256": "a368e4669cf0d9c0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But consider which sins you have left behind, or in what you have made progress."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0330",
      "source_sha256": "00140bc660aeb8e2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or what weakness have you corrected through fasting?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0333",
      "source_sha256": "3b41d68a91aa9836",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "See whether you have stopped swearing oaths and speaking frivolous words, idle words, or coarse jokes."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.000.0374",
      "source_sha256": "4876f42a6877c91e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "Therefore you have no defense, nor will you receive forgiveness for such things. How will you be able to lift your hands toward heaven while these things are in your soul?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.001.0000",
      "source_sha256": "8dc4c7f78489ed4c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "Therefore be reconciled with the one who brings a case against you, while he is with you on the road."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.001.0057",
      "source_sha256": "7d754e081d4b84dd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "For our conscience always finds fault with us, pricking us over what we have done, especially when we speak about the judgment that is to come."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.001.0086",
      "source_sha256": "ff6a107ec1303d69",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "Seek Paul as the blessed Thecla did, so that you may hear Paul's words."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.001.0100",
      "source_sha256": "6dd46dccdf02f10c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "If you want to resemble Christ, follow his footsteps."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.001.0102",
      "source_sha256": "715b7b3847cbbc86",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "Listen to the blessed Daniel saying, “I, Daniel, was mourning for three weeks.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.001.0116",
      "source_sha256": "6529d464969fb455",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "Therefore let us offer ourselves as a living, holy sacrifice, as it is written. We will offer ourselves not through fire, but through patience and endurance."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.001.0123",
      "source_sha256": "664e066664fed90b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "Acquire for yourself a good and blameless way of life, humility, and modesty."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.001.0164",
      "source_sha256": "c924cf5f18ea4879",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "In the place where the river of fire and the undying worm are."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.001.0170",
      "source_sha256": "caccfd8b696d293c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "He is the one who will uncover what is hidden in darkness and reveal the intentions of hearts, and examine our deeds, our thoughts, and our words."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.001.0182",
      "source_sha256": "0d8602971f718a5e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "One is being put to shame because he laughed improperly, at the wrong time."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.001.0188",
      "source_sha256": "17c1cf616032754f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "Another has been handed over to punishment without relief because of his hatred of evil."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.001.0228",
      "source_sha256": "9d30d4ae71334d81",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "But you will often say to me, “What is the proof of these words?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.001.0261",
      "source_sha256": "fbb00a4932e87ce9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "They will say to you, “Have you not heard the Lord crying out, ‘The kingdom of heaven has drawn near’?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.001.0275",
      "source_sha256": "deb69e3f5e1a2a60",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "Therefore we must be watchful in every direction, lest evil dwell in our soul."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.001.0297",
      "source_sha256": "3d94592c6f4ecbd7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "Let your lamp remain burning. Do not let them find you inattentive."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/john_constantinople#CopScr.john-constantinople.001.0313",
      "source_sha256": "e274911790903b46",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "Look at the suffering of those people and flee from their downfall."
    }
  ]
}
